{# ==========================================================================
   Template: sap_host_info_report.j2
   ===========================================================================
   Generates the SAP System Landscape Report (Pipeline 0: Host Info).

   Sections:
     1. Host Inventory & SAP Components - per-host instance table
     2. Update Applicability - per-host OS/kernel/HANA applicability flags
     3. Upgrade Applicability Guide (conditional) - kernel/HANA guide
     4. Process Details Appendix - full process lists per instance

   Instance role detection priority (by process name):
     hdbdaemon   → HANA Database Instance
     disp+work   → App Server (PAS/DIA)
     msg_server  → Central Services (ASCS)
     enqrepl*    → Enqueue Replicator (ERS)
     sapwebdisp  → Web Dispatcher
     smdagent    → Diagnostic Agent (DAA SID only)

   Version extraction:
     - HANA: from hdb_metadata (HDB version output)
     - Kernel: regex on mSapVersionInfo from sap.sap_operations.host_info
       Format: "Kernel <release> P<patch>" (e.g. "Kernel 7.77 P1234")
     - Kernel executable matrix: from instance.VersionInfo
       (GetVersionInfo via sap.sap_operations.host_info)
     - HANA Client: from hdbclient_metadata (hdbsql -v output)

   Global lists (appended across loop iterations for summary stats):
     global_kernel_releases - all unique kernel release numbers found
     global_patch_levels    - all unique patch levels found
   ========================================================================== #}
